silm:instances_papers_11_base_commutative_diagram_chapters_08_joc_and_regression_sections_03_failure_mode_atlas_concrete_anchor_28_FreePathCategoryFreeG11#freepathcategoryfreeg11 silm:hasLongDescription "The FreePathCategoryFreeG11 is the free path category on the page-11 generators graph G_11, unquotiented. In the paper's apparatus it appears as the symbol 'FreePathCategoryFreeG11', a concrete instance grounded in the Mittens domain story; it serves as the anchor whose semantics every diagram, formula, and prose reference back to." .
